      <h2>About Dive 710</h2>
      <p>Dive 710 in Jambiani is a locally-run PADI dive center offering guided dives to Mnemba Atoll and southeast coast reefs. Focus on small groups, marine education, and conservation. Services include PADI courses from Open Water to Divemaster, night dives, and coral restoration programs. Affordable rates with personal attention from local instructors who grew up diving these reefs.</p>

